WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.512
Who Voted to Kill — The Parliamentary Record.

00:00:03.462 --> 00:00:09.875
76,707 Canadians are dead because these MPs voted YEA.

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:11.525
Two bills.

00:00:11.525 --> 00:00:13.237
Two votes.

00:00:13.237 --> 00:00:19.875
109 MPs voted for both C-14 and C-7, legalizing and then expanding MAID.

00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:24.537
173 total unique MPs across both votes.

00:00:24.537 --> 00:00:28.875
The largest state-administered killing program in the Western world.
